[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - Product 1 is a secondary alcohol; PCC will convert it to a ketone.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - So, the product (Product 2) is: C6H5-CH=CH-CO-CH3 (α,β-unsaturated ketone)
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - Carbon count remains the same: 10 carbons.
