[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] But the problem states hexadecane smooth contact angle at 102°, octane should be between hexadecane and water values, so let's check what happens if we assume octane smooth contact angle is 102° (same as hexadecane).
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] Calculate \(\cos 102^\circ = \cos (180 - 78) = -\cos 78^\circ = -0.2079\)
