[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] \[
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] \langle \psi | \sigma_x | \psi \rangle = \begin{pmatrix}0.5 & \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \\ 0.5 \end{pmatrix} = 0.5 \times \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} + \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \times 0.5
