[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - D: 20.40 cm³
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] Closest volume to 28.08 cm³ is option B (28.05 cm³).
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] Option B has pH = 2.04, which aligns well with expected acidic pH from Fe^{3+} hydrolysis.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] ---
