[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] \]
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] Convert MeV to GeV (\(1 \text{GeV} = 10^3 \text{MeV}\)):
