[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] ### Starting material: (R)-(+)-Limonene
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - Limonene is a monoterpene with two double bonds: a disubstituted alkene in the ring and an exocyclic double bond.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - (R)-(+)-Limonene configuration is known at the stereocenter.
