[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] ### Step 2: Treatment of product 1 with mCPBA (3-chloroperbenzoic acid)
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - mCPBA is an oxidizing agent that epoxidizes alkenes.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - Product 1 has a ring alkene, which can be epoxidized.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - So product 2 will be an epoxide on the ring double bond.
