[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] The key points:
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - The epoxidation is stereospecific: the peracid approaches from the less hindered face.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - For limonene derivatives, epoxidation typically occurs on the ring double bond to form a 1,2-epoxide (cyclohexene epoxide ring).
