[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] ### Step 4: Treatment of product 3 with propanoic acid, dicyclohexylcarbodiimide (DCC), and catalytic DMAP
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
