[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 4. Since v-FLIP is recruited to the DISC (which is involved in the extrinsic apoptosis pathway) but is inactive, it likely blocks the recruitment or activation of caspase-8.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 5. Blocking caspase-8 activation prevents the initiation of the extrinsic cell death pathway.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 6. Therefore, v-FLIP expression would inhibit the cell surface death receptor (extrinsic) pathway of apoptosis.
