[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] D. It activates only the mitochondrial pathway — no, v-FLIP inhibits extrinsic pathway and does not activate intrinsic/mitochondrial pathway.
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] **Final answer:**
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
