[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] ### Step 1: Interpret abundance notations
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] By definition:
