[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] ### Step 2: Determine Si abundance for Star_1
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] We want n(Si)_1 / n(Si)_2. Let's first find nSi_1:
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] From [Fe/H]_1 = 0 dex,
