[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] Since it's not given, we can logically consider the relative abundance of Si with respect to Fe and/or Mg using commonly known solar abundances:
