[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] - Mg = 7.00 (given)
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] This aligns well: so we take:
[INFO] 10-07 19:35:58 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
