[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] B. \((x + 1)(x + 4)(x - 2)\)  
[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] C. \((x + 1)(x - 4)(x - 2)\)  
