[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] The set of all nth roots of unity consists of complex numbers defined as:
[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] \[
[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] \{ e^{2\pi i k/n} \mid k = 0, 1, 2, \ldots, n-1 \}
