[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] Qualitatively, by Lagrange's theorem, the order of any subgroup divides the order of the group.
[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] Since 8 does not divide 42, there is no subgroup of order 8, normal or otherwise.
