[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] ### Step 5: Is it irreducible for \(c=2\)?
[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] 
[INFO] 10-07 19:43:56 run_experiments_1.py:85] Yes, since no roots and no factors of degree 1 and 2, the polynomial is irreducible.
